  "catalogueCode": "EXP-2291-02",
  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>Five years following vent settlements as they moved across a surface that repaves itself, annotated throughout together with the people being recorded. The material is the best of its kind anywhere and almost none of it can be read: the community&#39;s own classification placed the greater part under closed knowledge, and the ruling of 2298 suspended contact and sealed the remainder. The expedition is regarded internally as a success and has produced no publications at all. Its deposit occupies four bonded crates and one argument that has been running since the ruling.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
    }
  ],
